REMARK   1 pH-dependent EGFR binder.
REMARK   1 McCann and Koder groups, The City College of New York.
REMARK   1
REMARK   1 ** EVERY BINDER COORDINATE HERE IS PREDICTED, NOT EXPERIMENTAL. **
REMARK   1 ** Nothing here has been tested at the bench. No number is an
REMARK   1 ** affinity. **
REMARK   1
REMARK   1 CHAIN MAP
REMARK   1   R   EGFR extracellular region, tethered. PREDICTED.
REMARK   1       WT numbering 1-621.
REMARK   1   X   egfr-siteA-id2015         75 aa  de novo design
REMARK   1   Y   egfr-siteA-id86           80 aa  de novo design
REMARK   1   Z   egfr-siteA-id3035         75 aa  de novo design
REMARK   1   W   egfr-siteA-id3036         75 aa  de novo design
